18:36.820 --> 18:38.340
Tak jaga kambing elok-elok!

18:38.340 --> 18:40.250
Macam mana kalau terlanggar orang?

18:40.250 --> 18:41.050
Xia Zi.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.420
Fang Nan.

18:44.730 --> 18:45.530
Awak tak apa-apa?

18:45.530 --> 18:46.080
Tak apa-apa.

