27:47.530 --> 27:48.160
Mak.

27:50.660 --> 27:51.250
Mak.

27:52.450 --> 27:54.250
Mak kira cukup atau tidak.

28:16.270 --> 28:16.950
Abang.

28:17.950 --> 28:18.840
